A. Frontend Architecture & Scalability

Evaluate:

Folder structure (feature-based vs layer-based)

API service abstraction (axios wrapper? fetch wrapper?)

Separation between:

UI components

Business logic

API layer

Hooks

Utilities

Reusability of shared components

Multi-tenant readiness (if applicable)

RBAC-aware UI rendering

Layout composition (Admin vs Storefront isolation)

