B. Data Fetching Strategy (Critical in PERN)

Audit:

API request duplication

Waterfall requests

Over-fetching

Lack of pagination

N+1 frontend request patterns

Client-side filtering instead of server-side filtering

Missing caching strategy

If using:

React Query → evaluate staleTime, cacheTime, invalidation

Redux → evaluate normalization

Context → evaluate re-render scope

Deliver:

Performance bottlenecks

Concrete improvement patterns

Suggested caching strategy

