CSRF protection (if cookies)

XSS exposure risks

Sensitive data leakage in Redux/store

Role-based UI enforcement vs backend enforcement

Token refresh flow robustness

Logout invalidation behavior

Deliver:

Security severity rating

Mitigation strategies

Recommended token architecture

